      "semantic_version": "1.0.0",
      "version_number": 1,
      "status": "PUBLISHED",
      "content_markdown": "# SRD Structure\n\nОбязательные секции артефакта:\n1. Introduction (purpose, scope, definitions, references)\n2. Overall Description (product perspective, user classes, constraints, assumptions)\n3. Functional Requirements (FR-001, ... с приоритетом P0/P1/P2 и acceptance criteria)\n4. Non-Functional Requirements (performance, security, availability, privacy)\n5. External Interfaces (UI / API / integrations)\n6. Data Requirements (entities, retention, классификация)\n7. Constraints & Dependencies\n8. Traceability Matrix (FR → BRD goals / user stories)\n9. Open Questions\n\nДокумент должен быть полным — без summary-only ответов.\n",
      "metadata": {},
